  "background": "Tongari Boushi no Atelier was nominated for the 11th Manga Taishou Award in 2018. It was also nominated for the 42nd and 44th Kodansha Manga Award in the General category in 2018 and 2020, respectively.\n\nThe series has been published in English as Witch Hat Atelier by Kodansha USA since April 9, 2019, and simulpub through K Manga. The manga has also been released in Spanish by Milky Way Ediciones since July 31, 2018; in Polish by Kotori since April 2019; in Brazilian Portuguese by Panini Comics since July 12, 2019; in Romanian by Nezumi since October 18, 2023; and in Ukrainian by Nasha Idea since June 11, 2020.",
